<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS7" title="In Appendix C Proof for Inverse Transform Watermarks in Section ‣ Optimal Detection for Language Watermarks with Pseudorandom Collision" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.7 </span>Proof of Lemma <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS8" title="In Appendix C Proof for Inverse Transform Watermarks in Section ‣ Optimal Detection for Language Watermarks with Pseudorandom Collision" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.8 </span>Proof of Lemma <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a>
