<span id="S1.T1.2.1.2.1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">from <span id="S1.T1.2.1.2.1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The Great Gatsby</span></span></span>
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.2.1.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.2.1.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">by F. Scott Fitzgerald</span></span>
</span></span><span id="S1.T1.2.1.2.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></td>
<td id="S1.T1.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:258.8pt;">
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Gatsby turned sharply. “Can’t repeat the past?… <span id="S1.T1.2.1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFBFBF;">Why of course you can!</span> <span id="S1.T1.2.1.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFBFBF;">Why of course you can!</span>” He looked around him wildly, as if the past were about to rise before his eyes.  (6 tokens)</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S1.T1.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span> <span id="S1.T1.2.1.3.1.2" class="ltx_text">
