<span id="S1.T1.2.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">And even in the whaleboat, in the stormiest gales, in the maddest tossing of the waves, the shouts of “<span id="S1.T1.2.1.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFBFBF;">All’s well!</span> <span id="S1.T1.2.1.3.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFBFBF;">All’s well!</span>” came to me across the water.  (4 tokens)</span>
</span></td></tr>
