</span></span><span id="S1.T1.2.1.4.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></td>
<td id="S1.T1.2.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:258.8pt;">
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Antony, addressing the crowd after Caesar’s death:
“He was my friend, faithful and just to me:
But <span id="S1.T1.2.1.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFBFBF;">Brutus says he was ambitious;</span>
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.4.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFBFBF;">And Brutus is an honourable man.</span>
…Yet <span id="S1.T1.2.1.4.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFBFBF;">Brutus says he was ambitious;</span>
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.4.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#BFBFBF;">And Brutus is an honourable man.</span>
…”  (7 and 9 tokens)</span>
</span></td></tr>
